# ne5-Settings — read coverage over the specimen sweep. Runs of bits sharing a verdict.
#
# varies   an instrument writes this bit two ways (OR against AND over every
#          corpus specimen of this body; all-ones bodies excluded). ⚠️ The
#          committed fixtures are left out of this column: they are this
#          crate's own writers' output over a zeroed body, so their unclaimed
#          bits are evidence of nothing.
# claimed  the path declaring it, from the layout — intent, not a read. A path
#          marked (unregistered) is declared but reports no value.
# answers  registry paths whose value moved when the bit was flipped and the
#          file re-parsed, over the sampled specimens; `refused` is the parser
#          rejecting the mutated file, which is a read too.
#
# Offsets are body-relative — a hex dump of the file adds the container's body
# start, 0x2c on a type-1 header and 0x18 on a type-0. Bits inside a byte are
# numbered LSB-first: `0x51[3:2]`.
#
# 272 bits; varies over 122 corpus specimens, answers over 124 flipped.

bits           at                                 claimed by                                   varies  verdict    answers
0..=15         0x00..0x02                         —                                            no      spare      —
16..=16        0x02[7]                            startup_set_list_mode                        yes     read       startup_set_list_mode
17..=17        0x02[6]                            startup_live_mode                            yes     read       startup_live_mode
18..=18        0x02[5]                            —                                            no      spare      —
19..=20        0x02[4:3]                          startup_live_slot                            yes     read       startup_live_slot
21..=21        0x02[2]                            startup_program                              no      read       refused, startup_program
22..=23        0x02[1:0]                          startup_program                              yes     read       startup_program
24..=24        0x03[7]                            startup_program                              no      read       startup_program
25..=29        0x03[6:2]                          startup_program                              yes     read       startup_program
30..=30        0x03[1]                            startup_song                                 no      read       refused, startup_song
31..=32        0x03[0]+0x04[7]                    startup_song                                 yes     read       startup_song
33..=34        0x04[6:5]                          startup_song                                 no      read       startup_song
35..=37        0x04[4:2]                          startup_song                                 yes     read       startup_song
38..=39        0x04[1:0]                          control_change_mode                          yes     read       control_change_mode
40..=41        0x05[7:6]                          program_change_mode                          yes     read       program_change_mode
42..=42        0x05[5]                            —                                            no      spare      —
43..=44        0x05[4:3]                          sustain_pedal_type                           yes     read       sustain_pedal_type
45..=47        0x05[2:0]                          ctrl_pedal_type                              yes     read       ctrl_pedal_type
48..=51        0x06[7:4]                          —                                            no      spare      —
52..=53        0x06[3:2]                          rotary_ctrl_type                             yes     read       rotary_ctrl_type
